WEBVTT

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.580
<i>Our first understudy concert.</i>

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:20.330
<i>I couldn't believe the euphoria I felt in that light.</i>

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.820
<i>I thought to myself...</i>

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.040
<i>that I wouldn't mind disappearing right there.</i>

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:35.180
What's going on?

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.640
Where did everyone go?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.750
Chieri!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:38.820
Girls!

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:45.680
Wait!

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:54.610
No!

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.240
Girls! Answer me!

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:57.950
Where are you?

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.920
Kirara!

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.630
Please, glow for me!

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.680
Be the light in this darkness!

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:13.140
<i>The Kirara aren't the only ones who glow.</i>

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.630
Acchan?!

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:17.630
<i>The radiance comes from within </i>you.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.450
<i>Fear not.</i>

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:21.140
<i>Sing at the top of your lungs</i>

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:25.310
<i>and make your presence known!</i>

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:30.810
Nagisa. Nagisa!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.070
I bet you were up all night practicing.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.280
Chieri?

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:43.450
First, let all the tension out of your shoulders and relax your torso.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:44.000
Like this?

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:46.580
One, two!

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.380
Relax and push!

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.630
My chest muscles aren't even twitching!

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:54.590
Just keep practicing.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.600
Where's Sonata's ribbon? Where?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.050
Ah-hah!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:01.300
Ker-boing!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:06.120
Sonati, you've got a crumb on your cheek from the snacks earlier.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:09.780
Huh?

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:10.850
It's tight...

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:12.270
Squeeze!

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:17.640
Hey, when we're on stage, can I
announce that your chest got bigger?

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.380
Gosh, of course not! Why would you do that?

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.460
Aw, don't be a spoilsport.

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.120
Come on, girls.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:25.580
It's nearly time to assemble.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:27.500
Let's go.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.590
This is where all our practice pays off.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.460
Okay!

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:45.700
<i>That's right. I'll sing at the top of my lungs!</i>

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.720
<i>I'll make my presence known!</i>

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:54.230
<i>And I'll show that we're AKB0048 now!</i>

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.480
I'm standing there

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.360
on the stage of my dreams,

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:06.570
amidst the thunderous applause and enthusiasm.

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:13.140
Those tough lessons helped me surpass my own limits.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:18.750
Now, today, the curtain rises on my big chance.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.960
Go, go!

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:19.630
Understudies!

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.800
Cut it out! We're undercover!

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:23.130
Some days, I just can't dance,

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.630
so I go home crying.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:29.900
Some days, I just can't sing,

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.360
You must be pretty excited, Yuuko-san.

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:33.260
so I lose faith in myself.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.100
You're risking someone recognizing us, you know.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:36.100
My rivals always seem

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:39.940
to glow so much brighter than me.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:42.190
I just had to know what it was like from the audience's perspective!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.610
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:43.820
You could have let me come alone.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:47.490
which bloom slowly like a flower.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.080
Yeah, and who knows what
trouble you would've caused!

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:49.360
I swear that I won't

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.700
let down their efforts.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.620
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.750
<i>These once normal young girls</i>

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:00.290
which lie budding, in wait,

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.800
<i>have felt pain and uncertainty, shed tears,</i>

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:02.080
until the day

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:06.480
<i>sang, danced, and brought happiness to all...</i>

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:07.130
our wishes blossom.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.580
Dance like there's no tomorrow!

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.510
Sing like there's no tomorrow!

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.550
Don't forget what you set out to do

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:20.210
and knock it out of the park!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:26.190
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:30.070
which bloom slowly like a flower.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.950
I swear that I won't

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.280
let down their efforts.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.710
<i>And, on that day...</i>

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.200
Our sweat carries our dreams,

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.460
The Center Nova phenomenon.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:42.870
which lie budding, in wait,

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:44.430
Each member gave birth to a Kirara and began to glow.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.670
until the day

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:48.460
our wishes blossom.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:49.540
Though none of those girls were successors yet,

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.850
I had not seen such a flood of light

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:55.800
since Acchan disappeared.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:33.630
The sunlight awaits at the windy station.

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:39.510
The clouds form a path in the sky.

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:45.020
I glance briefly at my watch

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:51.610
and gently heave a sigh.

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:56.410
Is someone holding you back, saying "don't go"?

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:56.410
kimi wa yuku na to hikitomerareteru no ka

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.000
<i>The radiance of the Kirara...</i>

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:58.960
<i>Was it just a fluke of beginner's luck back then?</i>

00:05:56.410 --> 00:06:02.080
Can you leave your love behind?

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:07.830
The rainbow train is about to depart,

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:07.830
niji no ressha ga jikoku doori ni

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:13.550
right on schedule, toward our dreams

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:13.550
yume ni mukatte shuppatsu suru yo

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.300
<i>I can't shake this premonition.</i>

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:19.140
I want to set off with you by my side.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:19.140
kimi to issho ni tabidachitai nda

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.270
<i>Nagisa and Chieri...</i>

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:26.020
Cast everything aside and let's go!

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:26.020
subete sutete yatte koi

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:29.030
<i>Those two might really have Center Nova potential.</i>

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.360
Thank you all so much!

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.180
Wh-What now?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.220
It's Mariko-sama!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:08.110
Mariko! Mariko! Mariko!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:03.730
This is AKB0048's general manager, Katagiri Tsubasa.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.480
Okay?

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:10.700
This may seem sudden, but lately the D.G.T.O.'s anti-entertainment effort,

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.450
as well as DES's attacks, has grown fiercer.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:21.330
In response, we've decided to take AKB0048 in a new direction.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:23.660
General Elections

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.090
Huh?!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:23.670
Stellar Calendar Year 0048

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:30.090
We're bringing back the
New Single General Elections.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.090
What?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.600
The General Elections?

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.850
And that's not all!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:36.350
The Return!

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.770
The Center Nova position is also returning!

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:37.310
Center       Nova

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:46.320
She never mentioned that before!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.150
Yuuko-san?

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.820
All right!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.920
Hey, look!

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.700
It's Yuuko!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.910
Are you out of your mind?

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.580
S-Sorry for the disturbance!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.250
See you again, everyone!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.720
- The Young Girls' Trial-

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:16.380
These General Elections aren't what I think they are, right?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:20.400
Fans vote for their favorite members, regardless of successor status,

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:24.320
and the top members get to be a part of the new single.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:28.360
They did that every year when the last Acchan was around.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.900
Sounds terrifying!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.200
It's like we're usurpers!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.200
That's not all.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.200
Seriously?

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.280
What's the administration thinking, bringing back the Center Nova?

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.910
Wasn't it declared too dangerous after Acchan disappeared?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.760
Not that the battle for Center matters to us.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.400
It's not like we even stand a chance of being elected.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.730
More importantly...

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:52.920
The rankings.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.300
They will show who's on top and who's on bottom.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.680
Who's on top... and who's on bottom?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.640
Who will fall?

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.820
I don't think you'll be that popular, Grumbly.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:11.980
Sonata!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.200
Take that back!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.200
Whoa-oa...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.540
Come on, that's enough bellyaching.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.040
It's dinner time.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.750
C-Coming!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.710
Awesome! It's sashimi!

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.210
That fish is giving me the evil eye!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.920
Hey, they've got karaoke.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.260
Oh, that's wonderful!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.760
I think I'll sing a bit later.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.760
Attention please!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.680
I hope you don't mind if I interrupt for a moment.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.930
Yuuko?

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:47.560
I'm prepared to give everything I've got

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.020
to become Center Nova!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.690
That means you're all my rivals!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.440
So bring it on!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:58.030
That means you girls, too.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.620
But we couldn't possibly be your rivals!

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.620
We're nowhere near your level.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.700
You don't have to act like
good little understudies.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:10.670
I'm not sure I can be a good
mentor anymore, either.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.500
Sorry, girls.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.100
Tsubasa-san.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.810
What is it, Takamina?

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:32.940
The General Elections will give Kanata another chance at succession, right?

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.280
Yes.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.950
Thank goodness.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.860
Was that bugging you?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:46.240
I told you before: young souls are always changing.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:52.500
Even if Kanata's soul does not become Takamina, she could be chosen to be another member.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.520
You just be there for her.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.380
And good luck with the Elections.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.220
You're our captain!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.640
You got it!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.560
The General Elections, huh?

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.780
The food looked so good, but I lost my appetite after that...

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.760
That really <i>was</i> quite the shock.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.830
I know. I didn't expect Yuuko-san to...

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.250
Nagisa, you're too good!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.710
And you're <i>totally</i> acting out of character.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:41.720
<i>I'm flattered that Yuuko-san considers us rivals.</i>

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.180
<i>But all this business about rankings...</i>

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.350
<i>It's just so...</i>

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.510
No!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:48.720
"No"?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.680
<i>Whoops...</i>

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.140
Yukirin, your oobs-bay are uge-hay!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.980
Th-They're not!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.320
Don't you agree, Mayuyu MK3?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.530
Oobs-bay are mere ornaments.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.990
Get down!

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.890
Mayuyu will not let you take these unfortunate girls.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.920
Sonata, are you okay?

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.600
My nobe id dribbing.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:36.640
Please get her a blanket or something!

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.320
She's only eleven!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.440
You AKB scum.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:45.450
Chieri!

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.800
Don't lay your filthy hands on Yukirin-san!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.200
How dare you! Do you realize—

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:50.700
What the...

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.040
We'd be happy to give handshakes and high-fives,

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:58.460
but other than that, we are
forbidden contact with men.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:12:59.880
Bullshit!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.210
Leave it.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.840
Yukirin-san...

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.260
That one's Sono Chieri.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.220
You mean she's Zodiac's...

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.810
Zodiac?

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:15.100
Well if the young lady insists.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.310
Sniffle-sniffle-gah!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.150
This stinks!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.200
We've received intel from the WOTA.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.570
It seems Yukirin and the other two have been taken to Kasumigastar.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.490
That's the planet where the High Court is.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.040
Correct.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:38.170
The D.G.T.O. intends to make use of wartime legal provisions to hold a speedy trial.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.460
By putting 00 on trial,

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:46.300
they hope to subdue the anti-government movement that idolizes us.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.930
"Guilty" is the only possible verdict.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.850
It's nothing but a show trial!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.560
Entertainment Admin. Dept.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.640
The Road to a
New Harmony with Entertainment

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.020
Entertainment Admin. Dept.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.020
The Road to a
New Harmony with Entertainment

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.150
Motomiya-san! This is terrible!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.300
Turn on the TV!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:12.080
AKB Trial Begins

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.110
We are moments away from the public trial

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:09.660
of three AKB0048 members arrested on charges of breaking the entertainment ban

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.910
and engaging in anti-government terrorist activity.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:11.250
Kuroki Ayako

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.120
Public?

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.790
AKB trial?

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:28.300
The defendants: AKB0048 members Kuroki
Ayako, Sono Chieri, and Shinonome Sonata.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.550
You are charged with the following:

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.560
The defendants have rebelled against the D.G.T.O.,

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.810
or Deep Galactic Trade Organization, which prohibits entertainment,

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.690
and are plotting a coup d'état against the government.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.690
Bite it back, Chieri.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.690
Don't react.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:49.260
The defendants have engaged in
illegal acts of public entertainment

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:51.570
to perturb and manipulate the hearts of the people

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.900
and have committed acts of terrorism to subvert the government.

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:57.860
We're not terrorists...

00:14:55.910 --> 00:15:00.290
The defendants' actions have bereft the people of their tranquility.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:58.960
Sonata...

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:06.760
With all due respect, AKB0048's actions are founded upon love.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:09.880
I am proud to be a member of 00!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:10.680
What?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.390
Defendant!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.100
Chieri!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:18.060
It won't be easy to breach the tight
defense surrounding Kasumigastar.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:22.020
Currently, WOTA reserve forces have assembled

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:27.540
and, as a diversion, are protesting the trial near spaceroutes.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.020
Sign: Entertainment is harmless!!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:33.370
We'll use that opportunity to launch in LAS
and make a hasty entry into the atmosphere.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.080
How forceful.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.600
O-Our first LAS trial by fire...!

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:40.460
Quit worrying, Makoto!

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.920
We've been training for this, remember?

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.790
Tsubasa-san, look!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:47.250
Defendant Sono Chieri.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.000
Emergency Broadcast: AKB Trial

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.460
Chieri...

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:53.180
You claim AKB0048's actions reflect <i>love?</i>

00:15:49.460 --> 00:16:03.560
Emergency Broadcast: AKB Trial

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.390
Even their attacks on DES?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:59.470
We would never hurt other people.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.580
When we encounter manned DES craft,

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.560
we are obligated to retreat.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.600
They're airing the trial live?!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.360
